# No environment variables are currently required.
#
# Previous deployments used Cloudflare Tunnel via a `cloudflared` container,
# which needed CLOUDFLARE_TUNNEL_TOKEN here. The setup now relies on
# Cloudflare Access (auth layer) in front of a directly-published origin
# on host ports 80/443. Recommended hardening on the VPS:
#
#   ufw allow from <cloudflare-ip-range> to any port 80
#   ufw allow from <cloudflare-ip-range> to any port 443
#   ufw deny  in  on <ext-iface>      to any port 80
#   ufw deny  in  on <ext-iface>      to any port 443
#
# Cloudflare IP ranges: https://www.cloudflare.com/ips/
